# Local scratch / debug / one-off validation scripts.
# All historical scratch scripts have been consolidated under scripts/scratch/
# (see move in commit on fix/mock-findings-honest-stub-tool-guard). The patterns
# below prevent any NEW root-level scratch file from leaking into a commit, and
